In the latest versions of Amelia (1.5), there is an "Output Log" button
(next to the "Impute" Button) that displays the output from the amelia run.
It also shows the R syntax used to generate the imputations. You can get the
latest version of amelia using the following command in R:

install.packages("Amelia", repos="http://r.iq.harvard.edu")

Hope that helps.

